@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #fffefa
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam defaultFontColor #30203e
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 165
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #6a5c70
  ArrowFontColor #30203e
  ArrowFontSize 13
  LifeLineBorderColor #8c7a97
  ParticipantBorderColor #6a5c70
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #eee7f9
  ParticipantFontColor #30203e
  ActorBorderColor #6a5c70
  ActorBackgroundColor #fffefa
  ActorFontColor #30203e
  GroupBorderColor #6a5c70
  GroupBackgroundColor #f6f3ee
  GroupHeaderFontColor #30203e
  DividerBorderColor #8c7a97
  DividerBackgroundColor #f6f3ee
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #fff7e3
  BorderColor #8c7a97
  FontColor #30203e
  FontSize 12
}

actor User
participant "Agent Integration" as Agent
participant "Plugin Runtime" as Runtime
participant "Active plugins" as Active

User -> Agent: Request plugin development
Agent -> Agent: Edit workspace source;\ncapture code and dependencies
Agent -> Runtime: Inspect dependencies;\nstage related changes
note over Runtime, Active
  Active versions keep serving existing workflows.
  Editing source does not select active revisions.
end note
Agent -> Agent: Run synthetic checks;\nretain revision-bound Check Receipt

alt Required checks fail
  Agent --> User: Report failure; no activation
else Required checks pass
  ref over Agent, Active
    Drain affected work and revalidate
    (next diagram)
  end ref
end
@enduml
